    <bpmn:userTask id="seen" name="Presses the pin that says where Tallinn Tastebuds was last seen on a bike">
      <bpmn:documentation>One pin that is not a place: a small red dot, put where the site's own account's last ride ended, 200 m short of where it stopped, and moved during a ride when that account asks the way by bike, in Rattatee or on the map. It stays where the last ride left it. Pressing it says when, and that according to Rattatee Tallinn Tastebuds passed through here.
when: seen_open
ref: assets/app.js toggleSeen()
