    <bpmn:userTask id="azeri-home" name="Opens /azeri on its home">
      <bpmn:documentation>Nothing on the map links to the corner: it is found by its address, a search or the sitemap. Who it is for in a sentence, a sentence leading to each of the other five tabs, and twelve questions people ask, each answered in a sentence or two and ending in the one link into the tab that says the rest. In Azerbaijani first, or English, Russian or Estonian.
when: page:azeri
when: azeri_home
ref: azeri.html
ref: assets/azeri.js
ref: azeri/data/guide/home.json</bpmn:documentation>
