    <bpmn:userTask id="azeri" name="Reads the films on /azeri">
      <bpmn:documentation>The Azerbaijani films tab, at ?tab=films. In Azerbaijani, English, Russian or Estonian; the feature films that can be watched first, the most watched leading, twenty to a page, and Watch plays one in the page. Nothing on it asks for an account, Watch included.
when: azeri_films
when: azeri_shelf
when: azeri_page
when: azeri_film
