    <bpmn:userTask id="azeri-community" name="Reads the posts on /azeri">
      <bpmn:documentation>What the corner's people write to each other: posts newest first or this week's most upvoted, twenty to a page, and a post with its comments oldest first, fifty at a time. Signed out, where a member would post, comment or upvote there is the way to sign in.
when: azeri_community
when: azeri_sort
when: azeri_post
when: azeri_more
ref: azeri.html
