    <bpmn:userTask id="azeri-guide" name="Reads the guide to Estonia on /azeri">
      <bpmn:documentation>Three tabs beside the films: Estonia and Studying, eight topics each that open in the page, and Estonian, seven — the language beside Azerbaijani, the levels, and five places to learn it, each with its button. In the same four languages. No figure that changes is written in it; every topic links the office that decides.
when: azeri_estonia
when: azeri_study
when: azeri_estonian
when: azeri_topic
